{"id":"2f7bd646c95b0642","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md","title":"Feller Semigroup","display":"df-feller-semigroup — Feller Semigroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-feller-semigroup","aliases":["58-df-feller-semigroup","Feller Semigroup"],"display":"df-feller-semigroup — Feller Semigroup","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-feller-semigroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-feller-semigroup</span><span>Feller Semigroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-feller-semigroup — Feller Semigroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1d11f892f3efc814\" href=\"?note=1d11f892f3efc814\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0e251de61cf71058\" href=\"?note=0e251de61cf71058\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\tau,P,A,\\mathcal D_A\\in V\">\\(S,\\tau,P,A,\\mathcal D_A\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 为下式定义的实数通常拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0(S,\\tau)\">\\(C_0(S,\\tau)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|f\\|_{\\infty,S}\">\\(\\|f\\|_{\\infty,S}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S\\)</span> 取依赖文件中的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FellerGenerator}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{FellerGenerator}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FellerGeneratorLimit}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{FellerGeneratorLimit}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 为辅助谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nC_0(S,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^S:\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,S,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(\n\\{x\\in S:|f(x)|\\geq\\varepsilon\\},\n\\{U\\cap\\{x\\in S:|f(x)|\\geq\\varepsilon\\}:U\\in\\tau\\}\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nC_0(S,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^S:\\ &amp;\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,S,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(\n\\{x\\in S:|f(x)|\\geq\\varepsilon\\},\n\\{U\\cap\\{x\\in S:|f(x)|\\geq\\varepsilon\\}:U\\in\\tau\\}\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\ \\to\\ \\|f\\|_{\\infty,S}\\coloneqq\\sup\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|f(x)|:x\\in S\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\ \\to\\ \\|f\\|_{\\infty,S}\\coloneqq\\sup\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|f(x)|:x\\in S\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,S,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S(S,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S(S,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(P,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},C_0(S,\\tau)^{C_0(S,\\tau)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land P(0)=\\{\\langle f,f\\rangle:f\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\}\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;P(s+t)=P(s)\\circ P(t)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall f,g\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad P(t)(\\{\\langle y,af(y)+bg(y)\\rangle:y\\in S\\})(x)=aP(t)(f)(x)+bP(t)(g)(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\|P(t)(f)\\|_{\\infty,S}\\leq\\|f\\|_{\\infty,S}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl((\\forall x\\in S\\;f(x)\\geq0)\\to\\forall x\\in S\\;P(t)(f)(x)\\geq0\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\forall x\\in S\\;|P(t)(f)(x)-f(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,S,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S(S,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S(S,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(P,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},C_0(S,\\tau)^{C_0(S,\\tau)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land P(0)=\\{\\langle f,f\\rangle:f\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\}\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;P(s+t)=P(s)\\circ P(t)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall f,g\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad P(t)(\\{\\langle y,af(y)+bg(y)\\rangle:y\\in S\\})(x)=aP(t)(f)(x)+bP(t)(g)(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\|P(t)(f)\\|_{\\infty,S}\\leq\\|f\\|_{\\infty,S}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl((\\forall x\\in S\\;f(x)\\geq0)\\to\\forall x\\in S\\;P(t)(f)(x)\\geq0\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\forall x\\in S\\;|P(t)(f)(x)-f(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FellerGeneratorLimit}_S(g,f,P,S,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,S,\\tau)\\land f,g\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\forall x\\in S\\;\n\\left|\\frac{P(t)(f)(x)-f(x)}{t}-g(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FellerGeneratorLimit}_S(g,f,P,S,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,S,\\tau)\\land f,g\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left(t&lt;\\delta\\to\\forall x\\in S\\;\n\\left|\\frac{P(t)(f)(x)-f(x)}{t}-g(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FellerGenerator}_S(A,\\mathcal D_A,P,S,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,S,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal D_A=\\{f\\in C_0(S,\\tau):\\exists g\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\;\\mathrm{FellerGeneratorLimit}_S(g,f,P,S,\\tau)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\mathcal D_A,C_0(S,\\tau))\n\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal D_A\\;\\mathrm{FellerGeneratorLimit}_S(A(f),f,P,S,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FellerGenerator}_S(A,\\mathcal D_A,P,S,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,S,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal D_A=\\{f\\in C_0(S,\\tau):\\exists g\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\;\\mathrm{FellerGeneratorLimit}_S(g,f,P,S,\\tau)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(A,\\mathcal D_A,C_0(S,\\tau))\n\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal D_A\\;\\mathrm{FellerGeneratorLimit}_S(A(f),f,P,S,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>State space and topology are arguments of the predicate because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0(S,\\tau)\">\\(C_0(S,\\tau)\\)</span> depends on both.</li>\n<li>Existence of an associated Hunt process requires additional hypotheses and is not definitionally equivalent to the Feller property.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ethier and Kurtz, Markov Processes</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d11f892f3efc814","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e251de61cf71058","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top2-hausdorff-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\tau,P,A,\\mathcal D_A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"C_0(S,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\|f\\|_{\\infty,S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2HausdorffSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FellerGenerator}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FellerGeneratorLimit}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;(x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nC_0(S,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^S:\\ &\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,S,\\tau,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(\n\\{x\\in S:|f(x)|\\geq\\varepsilon\\},\n\\{U\\cap\\{x\\in S:|f(x)|\\geq\\varepsilon\\}:U\\in\\tau\\}\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in C_0(S,\\tau)\\ \\to\\ \\|f\\|_{\\infty,S}\\coloneqq\\sup\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|f(x)|:x\\in S\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FellerSemigro